1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,880
Dead battery! Grandma waits!

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,685
Coldest morning of the year.

3
00:00:04,085 --> 00:00:06,123
Not today! I have a pie!

4
00:00:06,523 --> 00:00:07,941
We just need a second car!

5
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:10,939
Wait. Grandma's present is a jump starter!

6
00:00:11,339 --> 00:00:14,385
Red clamp to positive, black to bare metal. Press Power.

7
00:00:14,785 --> 00:00:15,990
I'll just hold these, then.

8
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:22,290
One paid roadside jump: about $50–$120 per 2026 third-party estimates.

9
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:26,744
The GB40 lists at $99.95 on NOCO's store, Nov 2026.

10
00:00:27,144 --> 00:00:29,924
You remembered my hour in the cold.

11
00:00:30,044 --> 00:00:32,550
Never again, Grandma! This one's yours.

12
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:35,321
I'll charge it every few months!

13
